      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1941016938529931705",
      "text": "[7:06AM] #InnerMarina #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood to go from UBA roundabout and NNPC filling station, approaching Kakawa junction has slow movement immediately after Kakawa junction towards Cathedral church Inward Nitel intersection is good.\n\nGood movement from State House connecting Force road.\n\nWhile movement from Zone 2 underneath bridge towards Flag staff House is good, approaching Mcwen bridge Inward Bonny camp has slow movement.\n\nGood movement from Onikan roundabout towards TBS Inward Water Board connecting Nitel intersection is good.\n\nThe entire stretch of Broad Street & Igbosere road is moving perfectly, likewise movement from Catholic mission Street connecting Ganiu Smith Street Traffic is looking good.",
